  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed: an in-process MCP tool call (SdkMcpTool.Handler) could run twice for a single model-issued tool use. The CLI enforces its own timeout on an mcp_message round trip and can retransmit an identical tools/call request if the handler is still running when that timeout fires; dispatch had no correlation between requests, so the retransmit re-invoked the handler and re-ran its side effect. tools/call is now memoized by JSON-RPC request id, so a duplicate arriving mid-flight (or after) is served the original call's result instead of executing again.",
